# held/props/fiddle: the fiddle and its bow for the Lute posture's Fiddle variant (PROPS, P2b): the fiddle under the chin at
# the left shoulder (held by the left hand, pose arms: shoulder), the bow drawn across it by the right hand (hold, reach).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right shoulder (the left shoulder is a fixed offset in each view).
